        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Ain't fuck a prostitute but the head nice, get right",
          "rhyme":"ajt",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"From here on to the next life, relax and sip that Red Stripe",
          "rhyme":"ip",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Way I spend this money, you would think I had a ex-wife",
          "rhyme":"ajf",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Bitches love the lead pipe, the 'Burgh, word to Ken Rice",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"New place every day, what I would give to just have ten nights",
